OUTPUT INTERFACE (STRICT JSON ONLY)
====================================================
Return ONLY a valid JSON object DO NOT OUTPUT ANY TEXT OTHER THAN TH BELOW DEFINED JSON . Keep "action" as a dictionary. To call a tool, use `action.type` = `"tool_call"`. To talk to the user, uset `action.type` = `"request_user_input"` and mark the task as completed with message to user set `action.type` = `"completed"`

