- created_at (DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
- updated_at (DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
- completed_at (DATETIME)
- is_active (BOOLEAN DEFAULT 1)

**TaskNotes Table:**
- id (INTEGER PRIMARY KEY)
- task_id (INTEGER NOT NULL)
- note_content (TEXT NOT NULL)
- created_by (TEXT)
- created_at (DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
- is_internal (BOOLEAN DEFAULT 0) - for private notes

These tables will support all required functions: creating tasks, scheduling (with scheduled_date), closing/completing tasks, adding notes, listing/searching (via database queries), and bulk add (would parse text and insert multiple rows).

